@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+---
+id: task-005-add-json-patch-generation
+type: task
+title: "Add JSON Patch generation"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implemented `createPatch(from, to)` as an exported RFC 6902 patch generator.
+
+It validates and clones both JSON inputs, emits compact structural changes for objects and arrays,
+and uses only `add`, `remove`, and `replace` operations. Added coverage for nested changes,
+array insertion/removal, root replacement, invalid JSON values, and input-reference isolation.
+
+Verified with `npm test` and `git diff --check`.
